Additional declaration — bundled voice data (data/starter.js, starter/):

The 32 voices in data/starter.js (and starter/FM-1_starter_bank.syx, the same
bytes as a Dexed-importable file) were designed within this project family
and are declared CC0 1.0 (public domain): usable without condition, not
subject to the MIT terms above, attribution not required.

This project does not distribute any third-party voice bytes. Voice banks
loaded at runtime from user files (or fetched from URLs the user supplies)
are not part of this distribution — the same legal line the sister project
fm1-tone-engine draws for the factory bank.
